    "detailed_description": "<i>Hellcoming is a co-op horror survival game for 1-4 players, who need to clean large areas from hellish abomination with the help of special tools.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>SAVE YOUR WORLD</u></h2><br>\u25b8<strong>HOW TO EXORCISE THE DEMON?</strong><br>You need to destroy the artifact that connects demon to your world;<br><br>\u25b8<strong>WHERE TO FIND ARTIFACT?</strong><br>You have to go through the portal to find the demon's shelter. There is a hellish altar with an artifact, but it's protected by runes; <br><br>\u25b8<strong>HOW TO DESTROY RUNES?</strong><br>Each rune relate to specific type of hellish abomination. Therefore, you need to cleanse unnatural things and kill hell creatures;<br><br>\u25b8<strong>WORK TOGETHER</strong><br>Help your friends escape from the imprisonment of demons. Watch your backs... and each others. Don't let them lock all players;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/891360/extras/835b94abf02e8766cd6b2717f205e239.poster.avif?t=1727695902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/891360/extras/835b94abf02e8766cd6b2717f205e239.webm?t=1727695902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/891360/extras/835b94abf02e8766cd6b2717f205e239.mp4?t=1727695902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>SPECIAL TOOLS</u></h2><br>\u25b8<strong>Vacuumer</strong> - picks up any liquids and has limited tank capacity;<br>\u25b8<strong>Brush</strong> - cleans up all kinds of dirt, but become dirty after a few cleanings;<br>\u25b8<strong>UV lamp</strong> - burns insects and hellish abomination, but overheats when operating;<br>\u25b8<strong>Shocker</strong> - kills medium-sized creatures and has limited amount of ammunitions;<br>\u25b8<strong>Bottle</strong> - fragile container with special liquid that extinguishes fire;<br>\u25b8<strong>Scanner</strong> - scans the location and displays the progress of cleanup on the monitor; <br>\u25b8<strong>EMF detector</strong> - helps you to find demonic creatures and objects;<br>\u25b8<strong>Medstation</strong> - creates injectors for healing players, if they wounded;<br>\u25b8<strong>Video cameras</strong> - you can watch some rooms from the monitor in your van;<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>ITS HARDER THAN YOU THINK</u></h2>\u25b8<strong>Stamina</strong><br>No one can run endlessly, even if he is running from a demon. Do not go far from the safe area.<br><br>\u25b8<strong>Big maps</strong><br>Each building has many rooms. Be careful while exploring the area and don't forget the path to the exit. <br><br>\u25b8<strong>Escalating difficulty</strong><br>Rage and speed of demon increases as the game progresses, as does the number of hellish creatures it spawn to stop you.<br><br>\u25b8<strong>Traps</strong><br>Watch your step. Traps may look harmless, but they can ruin your life. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/891360/extras/d4ec998b65ba89cbd392101cc6ed0e46.poster.avif?t=1727695902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/891360/extras/d4ec998b65ba89cbd392101cc6ed0e46.webm?t=1727695902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/891360/extras/d4ec998b65ba89cbd392101cc6ed0e46.mp4?t=1727695902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warning!</h2><i>This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</i>",
